   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hi,<div><br></div><div>I am running a mantel test on my dataset. As my species is a marine species, I calculated a distance matrix by the closest distance following the coastline and then converted the matrix into s<font face=\"Arial\">yntheti</font>c coordinates with the command:</div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">DistMat&lt;-viamaris(loccoor,extent.buffer = 5)</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">syncoor&lt;-isoMDS(DistMat)</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></p></div><div>But when I tried to run the ibd:</div><div><br></div><div>ibd&lt;-gl.ibd(x, distance = syncoor)</div><div><br></div><div>it comes up an error:</div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;color:rgb(47,180,29)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">Analysis performed on the genlight object.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">Error in .pointsToMatrix(p) : longitude &lt; -720</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><font face=\"Arial\">It seems like that the error is because some of my longitude value is &lt;-720. I did have some value </font></span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&lt;-720 after converting into synthetic coordinates. I am not sure it is normal that I can&#39;t run the command with this condition.</span></font></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
