     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Friday, 8 September 2023 at 12:17:14 pm UTC+9:30 Bernd. Gruber wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Hi Zoriana,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Not sure if I understand your create synthetic coordintes approach using the MDS.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>So you have a data.frame (assuming) that has two columns. Name those two columns ( “x” and “y”) and then you can\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Run <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>colnames(syncoor) &lt;- c(“x”,”y”)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>gl.ibd(x, coordinates=syncoor)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>This calculates Fst and again “Euclidean” distances  based on the coordinates.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>That should work.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>But you could also provide Dgen and Dgeo to  gl.ibd (providing the matrices) directly and then you do not need your mds (which looses some of the distance information as you convert it to a two dimensional\r\n distance [how much you loose depends on you stress value]).<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Hope that helps,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Bernd<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>p.s. Is there a paper that describes your approach?<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><br>\r\nFinally there is a least-cost implementation also in dartR if that helps…. gl.genleastcost<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div><div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> <a rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Zoriana Lam<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, September 8, 2023 12:31 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> dartR &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [dartR] IBD gl.ibd function error<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I am running a mantel test on my dataset. As my species is a marine species, I calculated a distance matrix by the closest distance following the coastline and then converted the matrix into s<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">yntheti</span>c\r\n coordinates with the command:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:black\">DistMat&lt;-viamaris(loccoor,extent.buffer = 5)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:black\">syncoor&lt;-isoMDS(DistMat)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">But when I tried to run the ibd:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">ibd&lt;-gl.ibd(x, distance = syncoor)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">it comes up an error:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:#2fb41d\">Analysis performed on the genlight object.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:black\">Error in .pointsToMatrix(p) : longitude &lt; -720<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">It seems like that the error is because some of my longitude value is &lt;-720. I did have some value &lt;-720 after converting into synthetic coordinates. I am not sure it is normal that I\r\n can&#39;t run the command with this condition.</span><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div><div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;dartR&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\">dartr+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/854c82e6-39d9-4177-a172-0f0cf28d3034n%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/854c82e6-39d9-4177-a172-0f0cf28d3034n%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458120543000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2WvJTTqlEjmgNBwt9r2jNQ\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/854c82e6-39d9-4177-a172-0f0cf28d3034n%40googlegroups.com</a>.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</blockquote></div>"
    ]
   ]
