   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Sounds like you have missing data.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>The error is in the mantel test routine I think, are the number of coordinates provided do not match the number of individuals.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Maybe check via <u></u>\r\n<u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>dist(syncoor) if you have missing values and also make sure the\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>coordinates match exactly the order of indivuduals in the genlight object.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>Cheers, Bernd<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Zoriana Lam<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, September 8, 2023 2:48 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> dartR &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Re: [dartR] IBD gl.ibd function error<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi Bernd,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I have figured out the problem I had was my issue with the synthetic coordinates that I prepared. But when I tried to rerun the test with my revised synthetic coordinates using the command you provided, I got another error but don;t understand\r\n what the error is about:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:#2fb41d\">Analysis performed on the genlight object.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:black\">Error in cor(as.vector(xdis), ydis, method = method, use = use) : <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:black\">  no complete element pairs<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\r\nCheers,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Zoriana<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">On Friday, 8 September 2023 at 12:17:14 pm UTC+9:30 Bernd. Gruber wrote:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote style=\"border:none;border-left:solid #cccccc 1.0pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 6.0pt;margin-left:4.8pt;margin-right:0cm\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi Zoriana,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Not sure if I understand your create synthetic coordintes approach using the MDS.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">So you have a data.frame (assuming) that has two columns. Name those two columns ( “x” and “y”) and then you can\r\n<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Run\r\n<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">colnames(syncoor) &lt;- c(“x”,”y”)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">gl.ibd(x, coordinates=syncoor)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">This calculates Fst and again “Euclidean” distances  based on the coordinates.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">That should work.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">But you could also provide Dgen and Dgeo to  gl.ibd (providing the matrices) directly and then you do not need your mds (which looses some of the distance information as you convert\r\n it to a two dimensional distance [how much you loose depends on you stress value]).<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hope that helps,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Bernd<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">p.s. Is there a paper that describes your approach?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br>\r\nFinally there is a least-cost implementation also in dartR if that helps…. gl.genleastcost<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\">\r\n<span><a href=\"http://da...@googlegroups.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://da...@googlegroups.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458120551000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3pB9L1cLjqZJIB1xKrH6QW\">http://da...@googlegroups.com</a></span> &lt;<span><a href=\"http://da...@googlegroups.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://da...@googlegroups.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458120551000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3pB9L1cLjqZJIB1xKrH6QW\">http://da...@googlegroups.com</a></span>&gt;\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Zoriana Lam<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, September 8, 2023 12:31 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> dartR &lt;<span><a href=\"http://da...@googlegroups.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://da...@googlegroups.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458120551000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3pB9L1cLjqZJIB1xKrH6QW\">http://da...@googlegroups.com</a></span>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [dartR] IBD gl.ibd function error</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I am running a mantel test on my dataset. As my species is a marine species, I calculated a distance matrix by the closest distance following the coastline and then converted the\r\n matrix into s<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">yntheti</span>c coordinates with the command:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:black\">DistMat&lt;-viamaris(loccoor,extent.buffer = 5)</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:black\">syncoor&lt;-isoMDS(DistMat)</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:black\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:black\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">But when I tried to run the ibd:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">ibd&lt;-gl.ibd(x, distance = syncoor)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">it comes up an error:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:#2fb41d\">Analysis performed on the genlight object.</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:black\">Error in .pointsToMatrix(p) : longitude &lt; -720</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Menlo&quot;,serif;color:black\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;font-stretch:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">It seems like that the error is because some of my longitude value is &lt;-720. I did have some value &lt;-720 after converting into synthetic coordinates. I am not sure it is normal that I\r\n can&#39;t run the command with this condition.</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">--\r\n<br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;dartR&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<span><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dartr+un...@googlegroups.com</a></span>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/854c82e6-39d9-4177-a172-0f0cf28d3034n%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/854c82e6-39d9-4177-a172-0f0cf28d3034n%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458120551000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0O6L3YV8Q2wT4rvFMIyYIX\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/msgid/dartr/854c82e6-39d9-4177-a172-0f0cf28d3034n%40googlegroups.com</a>.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div>"
